title: >-
  Digital Humanities and Artificial Intelligence in African Studies:
  Towards Sustainable and Equitable Practices (workshop website)
abstract: >-
  Website for the DFG Programme Point Sud workshop "Digital Humanities and
  Artificial Intelligence in African Studies: Towards Sustainable and
  Equitable Practices", held at the Stellenbosch Institute for Advanced Study
  (STIAS), South Africa, 21-24 September 2026. The bilingual (English/French)
  site publishes the call for papers, the programme, and the abstracts and
  biographies of participants.
